Z||000000||MooCow||04-28-2001||10:04 AM||||I got the cat remover on from Rodney Dickman and it sounds great.  The problem is that it had a leak so my buddy and I tried J B Weld to fill in the hole.  It worked at first but now it is just burning away and stinks real bad now.  Is there and other thing to use besides getting it welded on??  <P>Thanks Ken||||reg||5
